# Title: Suspicious Network Connection Binary No CommandLine
# ID: 20384606-a124-4fec-acbb-8bd373728613
# Status: test
# Level: high
# Author: Florian Roth (Nextron Systems)
# Date: 2022-07-03
# Tags: attack.stealth
# Description: Detects suspicious network connections made by a well-known Windows binary run with no command line parameters
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((Initiated:"true" AND (process_name:*\\regsvr32.exe OR process_name:*\\rundll32.exe OR process_name:*\\dllhost.exe) AND (cmdline:*\\regsvr32.exe OR cmdline:*\\rundll32.exe OR cmdline:*\\dllhost.exe)) AND -(((cmdline:"") OR (-cmdline:*))))
